<title>POLAND: Polisa Q1 net loss at PLN 1.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Polisa Q1 net loss at PLN 1.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polisa SA preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997     Q1 1996</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  1.67  vs   11.75</p>
<p>    net profit				1.67  vs   11.75</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Towarzystwo Ubezpieczeniowo-Reasekuracyjne Polisa SA.</p>
<p>    gross premium			  87.00  vs   57.82</p>
<p>    reinsurers share of premiums     20.88  vs    6.14</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		    0.05  vs    0.01</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    gross claims and benefits	  31.62  vs   24.43</p>
<p>    reinsurers share in claims	 13.08  vs    0.68</p>
<p>    technical result loss		 3.31  vs   12.31</p>
<p>    revenues from investments	   2.17  vs    0.59</p>
<p>    cost of investments		   0.12  vs    0.08</p>
<p>    other income			    0.99  vs    0.57</p>
<p>    other costs			     1.34  vs    0.52</p>
<p>    income tax				1.67  vs   11.75</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
